# Keep this file aligned with .containerignore. The duplicate policy is
# intentional defense in depth for Docker-compatible build frontends.
.git
.secrets/
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
coverage
# `vite build` output, in every unit.
dist
**/dist
.wrangler
**/.wrangler
.idea
.claude
.aiassistant
plans
*.log

# Gitignored local credential inputs. They are readable inside the dev
# container through the workspace bind, which is deliberate, but an image is
# shared and rebuilt from a clone — neither the root `.env` (Cloudflare and
# tunnel tokens, read by Compose on the HOST) nor the per-frame Wrangler
# overrides may be baked into one. `scripts/verify-build-context` proves it.
/.env
**/.env.development.local
